Package: mcmodel
Title: A simple r-based framework for constructing MCMC algorithms with strong control over sampling
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Alex J.", "Barth", , "alex.barth.science@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A set of R tools to implement MCMC algorithms with Gibbs and Metropolis-Hastings samplers entirely in R. This provides useful adaptation approaches and customizable sampling/saving. Can support multiple chain parallel.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
Imports: 
    coda,
    future,
    future.apply,
    abind
Depends: 
    R (>= 4.1.0)
